2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]     whose CLOSE time (bar-start + 15m) is <= POS.entry_time. A fresh entry can no
2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]     longer be ejected on price action that happened before it was opened.
2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]   + FIX C (SMA8 arm window): trail arms on bars-SINCE-ENTRY, not bars-of-day.
2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]     sma8_low_of_option() now averages only TODAY's closed bars that closed AFTER
