2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]     the block when a CLOSED FUT 15m bar breaks the recorded first-hour range by
2026-07-16 03:37:09,772 [INFO]     >= CHOP_REARM_BUFFER_PT (15pt) with body >= CHOP_REARM_BODY_MIN (65%), in the
